/**
 * StemProfile service worker: makes the app work offline (print shop, hotel,
 * race morning) and installable.
 *
 * - Every asset the app needs is precached on install. The list below is
 *   generated by scripts/stamp-assets.mjs from index.html, so it always holds
 *   the exact content-hashed URLs the current page loads.
 * - Versioned assets (?v=<hash>) never change: served from the cache first.
 * - Pages are network-first so a deploy shows up on the next online visit,
 *   with the cached copy as the offline fallback.
 * - Only same-origin GET requests are handled; the app makes no other requests.
 *
 * A new deploy changes this file (the list changes), so the browser installs
 * the new worker, which precaches the new assets and deletes the old cache.
 */

// asset-stamp:precache (generated by scripts/stamp-assets.mjs, do not edit)
